-- Control fixture for the @nonexhaustive decorator: this is ok/nonexhaustive-decorator.l4
-- WITHOUT the decorator, so the non-exhaustive CONSIDER in `unwrap` (missing
-- WHEN NOTHING) must WARN. (On this line warnings are non-fatal to
-- SuccessfulTypeCheck, so the file lives in ok/ and the golden pins the
-- warning text; the decorated twin's golden pins its absence.)
GIVEN m IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
unwrap m MEANS
  CONSIDER m
  WHEN JUST x THEN x
